00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:57.900
finally, get this, these were combined into a&nbsp;
video by Stable Diffusion. Lovely work. So cool!

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:04.080
Two, this incredible photorealistic&nbsp;
image was created by a custom model.&nbsp;&nbsp;

