These are typically specialized models&nbsp;
that are fine-tuned to do particularly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:15.480
well at a given topic. This one is&nbsp;
for photorealism, but there are tons&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:20.880
of other ones out there as well that make&nbsp;
Stable Diffusion an absolute powerhouse.

